[gd_scene format=3]

; Garage 1 PSX props: static scenery only (no scripts, no collision, no physics).
; Frame = the HOME frame (home_garage.gd): the Civic is at the origin, nose +x, floor y = 0, the warehouse's long
; side wall is the plane z = -2.6 (the camera is at +x +z, so props on that wall face +z), the end wall is x = -7.5.
; Every prepared prop faces +z with its origin at the middle of its footprint on the floor
; (art/blender/prep_garage1_props.py); tools hang with their back on the origin plane.
; Move or swap any node freely; positions are in metres.

